  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1288/713/skilltree_a_1000-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></p><h2>⭐️ 选择你的道路 - 塑造职业的技能</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-法术引擎-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"SpellEngine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8&amp;labelColor=6A7EC2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><hr><h2>✨ 探索更多RPG系列内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"潜行者\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h1>📦 安装</h1><h3>必需组件</h3><ul>\n<li>Pufferfish Skills</li>\n<li>弓箭手 (RPG系列)</li>\n<li>圣骑士与牧师 (RPG系列)</li>\n<li>潜行者与战士 (RPG系列)</li>\n<li>巫师 (RPG系列)</li>\n</ul><h1>🌴 特色功能</h1><p>探索全新的技能树，为RPG系列职业提供100+个独特节点。</p><ul>\n<li>将每个职业专精于进攻或防御方向</li>\n<li>法术修饰技能节点 - 部分技能可修改现有法术，以独特方式增强威力</li>\n<li>被动法术技能节点 - 部分技能赋予被动能力，可与现有法术组合使用</li>\n</ul><p>通过收集经验值获得技能点来解锁技能。经验值在团队成员间共享。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/832/full_tree-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></p><h2>↔️ 有意义的选择</h2><p>本模组提供独特的专精选择，而非单纯让角色变得无敌的线性解锁路径。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/837/frost_nova-png.png\" alt=\"冰霜新星\"></p><h2>🐣 法术修饰</h2><p>部分技能选择会修改你已掌握的法术，改变你的游戏方式或与他人的互动模式。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/839/judgement-png.png\" alt=\"审判\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/836/blood_barrage-png.png\" alt=\"血瀑术\"></p><h2>🌟 被动法术</h2><p>获取始终伴随你的新被动法术。这些法术具有各种触发条件、效果和战斗联动机制。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/834/arcane_ward-png.png\" alt=\"奥术结界\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/833/ambush-png.png\" alt=\"伏击\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/835/blazing_speed-png.png\" alt=\"炽热疾速\"></p><h2>💔 重置技能树</h2><p>想要放弃当前配点？获取并使用遗忘宝珠，即可重置并返还技能树上的已用点数。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1261/840/orb_of_oblivion_1_shadow-png.png\" alt=\"重置宝珠\"></p><h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1><p>创建属于你自己的RPG服务器。使用我们的促销码可享优惠价格，同时支持我们的开发。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p><h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1><p>探索由我们挚爱的合作伙伴制作的各种法术引擎模组！</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"混乱\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展 (更多RPG职业)\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士 (更多RPG职业)\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素巫师 (更多RPG职业)\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"原力大师 (更多RPG职业)\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人 (更多RPG职业)\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
